# Sun Sports — data and domain

## Layering

- **Repository interface** lives in `domain/repositories/`; **implementation** in `data/repositories/` with suffix `*RepositoryImpl`
- **Remote/local datasources** in `data/datasources/` — repositories orchestrate them and map to entities

## Models

- Prefer **freezed + json_serializable** for DTOs/state already generated in the feature; run **`build_runner`** after changing annotated models
- Keep **entities** in `domain/entities/` free of `json_annotation` when possible; conversion in mappers or `toEntity()` on models

## Async contracts

- Expose **`Either<Failure, T>`** from repositories; let notifiers/providers fold into UI state (loading/error/success)
- Reuse **`Failure`** variants from `core/error/failures.dart` instead of raw strings in domain code

## Calls from UI

- Widgets should not call `Dio`/`http` directly; go through providers → repository/use case
